GRAVITY BOUNCE  v3  //  NEON ORBIT
----------------------------------
Keep the ball bouncing across eight worlds while the arena fights back.
Earn coins, buy skins and permanent upgrades, and complete missions.

NEW IN v3
* Difficulty: MEDIUM / HARD / EXTREME (smaller platform, faster ball,
  limited paddle speed, more hazards, bigger coin + score multipliers).
* Hazards: solar WIND gusts and falling EMP bombs. A red column warns
  you where an EMP will land - if it hits the platform you are stunned.
* Power-ups (float in the ball's flight path): S shield, W wide, M magnet.
* WARP energy: perfect bounces charge it; press SPACE when full for
  slow motion.
* 8 worlds, neon cyber-grid scenery, holographic platform glow.
* Shop: ball skins, platform skins and permanent UPGRADES.
* Missions with coin rewards, per-difficulty best scores.

Controls: mouse or <- -> / A D = move | SPACE = warp / skip countdown
          P / Esc = pause | G = aim guide | R = restart
Progress is saved in your home folder (compatible with v2 saves).
"""
